<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="87fc2863-a614-5c12-8407-90146b7da2b8" activityNameId="897e9788-e48e-58ee-8301-4b16aa3c0613" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Resistor, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Resistor, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical SMD resistor for surface mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such resistors and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of resistors with a weight of 9.8 miligram/unit. Updates were made in 2023, mainly concerning the regionalization of energy and material input flows; UUID: 2280a862-e4ed-31d3-aa73-55d44d7a6cf9
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used SMD resistors for surface mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD resistors
Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2280a862-e4ed-31d3-aa73-55d44d7a6cf9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD resistors</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2023-01-01" endDate="2029-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="false">
        <comment>
